{"The Population Police require your attendance at a meeting at \003eleven o’clock\004 in the town square. You will be issued a new identity card. No other cards or papers will be valid after these cards are issued, Luke said in a rush.","Among the Free","Margaret Peterson Haddix",true},
{"Shanghai’s clocks were set an hour ahead so the city could “save daylight”, but the Bai family said: “We go by the old clock.” Ten o’clock to them was \003eleven\004 to everyone else. Their singing was behind the beat; they couldn’t keep up with the huqin [Chinese string instrument] producing bleak and desolate sounds of life.","Love in a Fallen City","Eileen Chang",true},
{"A scarlet steam engine was waiting next to a platform packed with people. A sign overhead said Hogwarts Express, \00311 o’clock\004.","Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone","J.K. Rowling",true},
{"She quit at \003eleven\004. Fuck it. She went around the house to the shed, got the spade and shovel, paused, and added a crowbar. She started out of the shed, went back, and took a screwdriver and an adjustable wrench from the toolbox.","The Tommyknockers","Stephen King",false},
{"Baba Diop spent the final thirty-six hours of his life at Fleury-Mérogis. At \00311 a.m.\004 on the second day, he was stabbed in the throat with a sharpened comb while being led under escort to the governor’s office.","The Nameless Ones","John Connolly",false},
