{"Five minutes later another truck pulls up behind the first. On the side of this one is a grinning cartoon boy woofing down a double cheeseburger. At \003eleven-thirty\004, while people are lined up for burgers and fries and tacos and enchiladas, a hotdog wagon appears.","Billy Summers","Stephen King",true},
